    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a genetic allele with a value and an alphabetic order. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_allele" kindref="compound">Allele</ref> class stores a numerical value representing the strength or effect of the allele, and an alphabetic order used for ordering or comparison tasks in genetic algorithms or species genetics. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
